WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.376 --> 00:00:04.993
Unit six. First Aid and CPR Basics!

2
00:00:05.968 --> 00:00:10.548
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:10.598 --> 00:00:13.651
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:18.350
Today we learn about First Aid and CPR Basics. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.877 --> 00:00:23.977
CPR. Say it with me. CPR!

6
00:00:27.482 --> 00:00:32.066
Chest compression. Say it with me. Chest compression!

7
00:00:35.516 --> 00:00:39.600
Rescue breath. Say it with me. Rescue breath!

8
00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:46.376
AED. Say it with me. AED!

9
00:00:49.872 --> 00:00:54.389
Unresponsive. Say it with me. Unresponsive!

10
00:00:57.848 --> 00:01:02.998
Emergency response. Say it with me. Emergency response!

11
00:01:06.561 --> 00:01:11.077
Certification. Say it with me. Certification!

12
00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:19.299
Chain of survival. Say it with me. Chain of survival!

13
00:01:22.836 --> 00:01:39.688
CPR uses chest compression and, in some methods, a rescue breath to help someone whose heart has stopped. An AED can help restart a heart in an unresponsive person. Getting a certification teaches the full emergency response chain of survival.

14
00:01:39.738 --> 00:01:43.205
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:44.132 --> 00:01:49.496
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:49.546 --> 00:01:50.874
Rescue breath!

17
00:01:51.768 --> 00:01:56.772
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:56.822 --> 00:01:58.082
Certification!

19
00:01:59.279 --> 00:02:06.897
Did you know? Immediate CPR can double or triple a person's chance of survival after a sudden cardiac emergency.

20
00:02:06.947 --> 00:02:09.229
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:10.235 --> 00:02:19.470
Think and answer. Why might learning CPR be a valuable life skill?

22
00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:20.744
Great answer!

23
00:02:21.678 --> 00:02:26.891
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:26.941 --> 00:02:29.697
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

